+# Persistent CA for Testing
+
+This directory contains persistent CA certificates that survive container restarts.
+
+## Structure
+
+- `root-ca.pem` - Root CA certificate (import this into browsers)
+- `root-ca-key.pem` - Root CA private key
+- `intermediate-ca.pem` - Intermediate CA certificate
+- `intermediate-ca-key.pem` - Intermediate CA private key
+
+## Usage
+
+These certificates are generated once and reused across container restarts,
+so you only need to import the root CA into your browser once.
+
+## Generation
+
+Run `./generate_ca_certificates.sh` to create the CA certificates.
